Package: nas-flash
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: rpi-imager (>= 1.7)
Maintainer: Romain Groux <romaingroux@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: Flash Raspberry Pi OS images onto an SD card
 Command line application to write a Raspberry Pi operating system image onto
 an SD card, as part of the Raspberry Pi NAS project. The Python runtime is
 bundled, so no system Python is required. Runs on amd64 Linux.
